        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="Story_container"><div class="Story_data"><div class="Story_title"><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47655408"><span>Show HN: I built a tiny LLM to demystify how language models work</span></a><a href="https://github.com/arman-bd/guppylm" target="_blank" class="Story_link">(https://github.com/arman-bd/guppylm)</a></div><div class="Story_meta"><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47655408">901 points</a></span><span class="Story_separator">|</span><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=armanified"><span>armanified</span></a></span><span class="Story_separator">|</span><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47655408">3 days ago</a></span><span class="Story_separator">|</span><span><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47655408">134 comments</a></span><div class="Story_comment"><span>Built a ~9M param LLM from scratch to understand how they actually work. Vanilla transformer, 60K synthetic conversations, ~130 lines of PyTorch. Trains in 5 min on a free Colab T4. The fish thinks the meaning of life is food.<p>Fork it and swap the personality for your own character.</p></span></div></div></div></div>]]></content>
